eight="44"><span><span class="nm">Ulises Heureaux</span><span class="tp">1845–1899</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eva-peron"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eva-peron.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Eva Perón</span><span class="tp">1919–1952</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/carlos-castillo-armas"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/carlos-castillo-armas.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Carlos Castillo Armas</span><span class="tp">1914–1957</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
